<title>USA: Campbell Soup sets $1.5 bln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Campbell Soup sets $1.5 bln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CAMDEN, N.J. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Campbell Soup Co said on Thursday it is launching a set of strategic actions to accelerate its sales and earnings growth, including a $2.5 billion stock repurchase program.</p>
<p>The company said it will take an after-tax charge of about $160 million in first quarter of fiscal 1997 to cover restructuring and related expenses.</p>
</text>
